{"id": "family-housing-state-funding-delay", "title": "State funding setbacks pushed family housing lease-up into 2029", "seconds": 54.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "b014c7100cb6152b", "words": 156, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco backed a plan for 73 affordable family apartments.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.91, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "73 apartments", "label": "June 2022 loan evaluation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.82, 1.09, 1.16, 1.49, 1.65, 2.3, 2.8, 3.13]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Half the homes were reserved for families who had experienced homelessness.", "t0": 4.03, "t1": 7.26, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "initial", "kicker": "Housing commitment", "text": "Half the apartments", "mark": "June 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.41, 0.69, 0.84, 1.22, 1.37, 1.76, 1.89, 2.02, 2.61]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The first state application sought over 30 million dollars and failed a threshold test.", "t0": 7.38, "t1": 11.83, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30.22 million", "label": "Round 1 request"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.38, 0.64, 1.27, 1.55, 1.8, 2.11, 2.42, 2.9, 3.18, 3.53, 3.61, 4.06]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The second application was recorded as not reviewed.", "t0": 11.95, "t1": 14.51, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "r2", "kicker": "State award register", "text": "Not reviewed", "mark": "Application 11"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.46, 1.08, 1.23, 1.69, 1.86, 2.08]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The sponsors dropped a planned service expansion and studied about 96 apartments.", "t0": 14.73, "t1": 19.22, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "About 96", "label": "Proposed redesign"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.61, 0.91, 0.98, 1.31, 1.67, 2.32, 2.58, 2.96, 3.27, 3.92]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The estimated budget rose from 88.5 million dollars to about 106 million.", "t0": 19.34, "t1": 24.74, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$106 million", "label": "Redesigned project estimate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.65, 1.05, 1.34, 1.52, 2.01, 2.3, 2.65, 3.0, 3.68, 3.89, 4.23, 4.44, 4.75, 5.02]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The city expected the cost per apartment to fall.", "t0": 24.86, "t1": 27.33, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bla", "kicker": "Project costs", "text": "Lower projected cost per apartment", "mark": "page 27"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.92, 1.04, 1.35, 1.54, 1.99, 2.11]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The expected lease-up moved from December 2026 to March 2029.", "t0": 27.45, "t1": 31.51, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "bla", "kicker": "Lease-up estimate", "text": "December 2026 to March 2029", "mark": "page 26"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.63, 1.02, 1.24, 1.38, 1.78, 2.09, 2.7, 2.88, 3.17, 3.45]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Supervisors authorized another two million dollars to refinance acquisition debt.", "t0": 31.63, "t1": 35.76, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2 million", "label": "Additional loan authority"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.78, 1.32, 1.64, 1.84, 2.16, 2.52, 2.68, 3.35, 3.89]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The interest-free loan would lower the cost of holding the site.", "t0": 35.88, "t1": 38.76, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vote", "kicker": "Acquisition loan", "text": "Lower holding costs", "mark": "File 241135"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.74, 1.07, 1.29, 1.53, 1.66, 2.01, 2.13, 2.42, 2.52]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The city still listed the expected state financing as uncommitted.", "t0": 38.98, "t1": 42.22, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "delivery", "kicker": "City funding table", "text": "State sources uncommitted", "mark": "first half of 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.7, 1.01, 1.16, 1.67, 1.98, 2.57, 2.7]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In June 2026, Planning listed 73 approved homes and zero completed.", "t0": 42.34, "t1": 47.02, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "0 completed", "label": "73 in the planning register"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.44, 0.72, 1.56, 1.94, 2.27, 2.92, 3.3, 3.65, 3.87, 4.17]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "That count covers the original permit. Financing for the redesign remains unconfirmed.", "t0": 47.14, "t1": 51.72, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "permit", "kicker": "Original building permit", "text": "73 proposed homes", "mark": "permit 202201105662"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.48, 0.79, 0.93, 1.33, 2.18, 2.71, 2.84, 2.96, 3.55, 3.93]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 51.84, "t1": 53.95, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The funding rounds", "b": "The redesign", "c": "The public record"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "question"}